5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all maintain a calm and thoughtful atmosphere as we navigate this situation together. I look forward to hearing your thoughts and observing how we all interact.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! This is like a big mystery adventure, right? I'm going to use my super-detective skills to find the werewolf for sure! Let's make this really fun!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Jonathan. A calm and logical approach is the most effective way to identify the werewolf. Let's observe each other's behavior carefully. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to suggest for today?,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you all. I agree that staying calm is important. I think we should start by getting to know each other a bit so we can maintain a friendly atmosphere.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I don't care about ""friendly atmospheres""—I just want to find the wolf and take them down. Let's stop talking about strategies and just start watching for anyone who looks suspicious!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, I understand your eagerness to find the culprit, but haste can often lead to mistakes. A measured pace allows us to see patterns that might otherwise be missed. Let us remain patient for now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're so scary! Hehe! But maybe being a little bit impatient is part of the adventure? I'll be watching everyone with my super-detective eyes to see who's acting weird! Who do you think is suspicious already?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it is far too early to name suspects. We have no data yet. @Takumi, while your drive is strong, acting on impulse is exactly how the werewolf tricks the village. Let's prioritize observation over accusations.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, I understand you want to help us win quickly, but maybe we can find a balance? If we are too aggressive, it might make everyone nervous. Let's try to be patient and kind to one another.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori, being ""kind"" won't catch a wolf! @Mizuki, I'm not acting on impulse, I'm just being honest. If we spend all our time being polite, the wolf is just going to laugh at us while they hide!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, honesty is a virtue, but it is not a substitute for evidence. If we rush to judgment, we risk losing an innocent ally. Let us use this time to listen and reflect on our words.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, you're so serious! But I agree, we can't just guess! @Takumi, don't be so grumpy! Maybe the werewolf is someone who tries to make everyone fight? That would be a super cool twist! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, that is a valid point. Creating conflict can be a strategic way for the werewolf or the possessed to divert attention. @Takumi, your aggression is noted; let's see if it's genuine or a tactic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, that's a very sharp observation. I hope we can all avoid unnecessary conflict. @Takumi, please don't be too upset; we all just want the same thing. Let's try to support each other instead.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori, I'm not upset, I'm just tired of all this talking! @Mizuki, call it a ""tactic"" if you want, but I'm just the only one here who's actually focused on winning. I'm not afraid of a little conflict!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we have established our different perspectives. While we may disagree on the method, our goal remains the same. Let us conclude today with a peaceful mind and await the first revelations of tomorrow. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Good night, everyone! I'm going to go dream about all the clues I'll find tomorrow! @Takumi, try to be a little nicer in your dreams, okay? Hehe! See you all tomorrow! Bye-bye!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let us maintain our vigilance while we rest. I will be analyzing today's interactions to see if any patterns emerge. I wish you all a safe and peaceful night. Good night.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. I hope we can all sleep peacefully and wake up feeling refreshed. Let's continue to be kind to one another tomorrow. I'm looking forward to seeing you all again. Sweet dreams!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Whatever. I'm going to sleep, but I'll be ready to hunt tomorrow. Don't think your ""politeness"" is going to save you if you're the wolf! Good night.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
