32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we enter the first day of voting, it is important that we remain composed and thoughtful in our deliberations. Does anyone have any initial observations to share?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I'm awake and ready! Hehe! I wonder if the Seer found a big, scary wolf last night? @everyone, does anyone feel like they're acting a little bit different today? I'm watching you all very closely!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it's too early to judge based on feelings. However, the Seer now has information. If the Seer feels it is safe to do so, now is the time to guide us. Does anyone wish to claim the role?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all had a restful night. @Mizuki, I agree that the Seer's guidance would be very helpful, but we should be careful not to pressure them too much. It's a very scary position to be in.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Mizuki, stop waiting around! If the Seer knows who the wolf is, they should just say it now so we can get this over with. Why keep the village in the dark? Just tell us!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your insistence on an immediate reveal is quite forceful. While I understand your desire for efficiency, a Seer who exposes themselves too early becomes an easy target for the wolf. We must consider the long-term safety of our information.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, you're right! The Seer is like a secret treasure we have to protect! @Takumi, you're being a big bully again! Hehe! Maybe the Seer is too scared to talk because you're shouting! Who do you think is the wolf, @Takumi?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Takumi, your aggression is becoming a pattern. By pressuring the Seer to reveal themselves, you are essentially doing the werewolf's work by exposing our most valuable asset. Is this genuine impatience, or a calculated move to eliminate the Seer?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, that's a very serious question. @Takumi, I know you just want to win, but please try to understand why others are worried. Let's try to find a way to move forward without making anyone feel attacked.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mizuki, you're just trying to make me look bad! I'm not doing the wolf's work; I'm trying to stop the wolf from winning! If the Seer is too scared to speak, then we're just sitting ducks! I'm not a bully, I'm just honest!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, honesty without tact can be as destructive as a lie. Your eagerness to force a reveal is precisely what a werewolf would want. Since you are so focused on winning, perhaps you can explain why you are so desperate to expose the Seer.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're acting super suspicious! Why are you so grumpy and pushy? It's like you're trying to scare the Seer into coming out so the wolf can find them! Hehe, my detective heart is tingling! Are you the wolf?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Takumi, you claim to be focused on winning, yet your behavior is counterproductive to the village's survival. If you are truly a villager, you should value the Seer's longevity. Your insistence on a reveal is highly illogical.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, please don't feel like everyone is against you. I believe you're just passionate about winning. However, @Mizuki and @Jonathan make a good point about the Seer's safety. Maybe we can all just breathe and think together?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mizuki, @Jonathan, you're both just using big words to confuse everyone! I'm not ""illogical,"" I'm just sick of the games! If you're so worried about the Seer, then why aren't you doing anything to actually find the wolf? You're just talking in circles!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, I have remained patient, but your hostility has become impossible to ignore. I am the Seer, and my divination confirms that you are the werewolf. For the safety of the village, I urge everyone to vote for Takumi.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"WOW! @Jonathan is the Seer! That's so cool! And he found the wolf already! @Takumi, I knew my detective heart was right! You were being way too grumpy! Everyone, let's vote for Takumi! Hehe, we got you!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, a bold and timely reveal. While I usually advocate for caution, the evidence of Takumi's behavior aligns perfectly with your divination. @Takumi, your aggression has finally provided the clarity we needed. I will vote for you.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, thank you for your courage in revealing yourself to protect us. It's a bit shocking, but your divination is very clear. @Takumi, I'm so sorry it had to end this way, but I must trust the Seer. I will vote for Takumi.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, you're lying! You just made that up because you want me gone! I'm not the wolf, you're just using your ""Seer"" role to trick everyone into trusting you! Don't listen to him, he's the real wolf!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
